Position Overview:&nbsp;

We are seeking a skilled and detail-oriented company secretary to joint our UK based team as a&nbsp; Senior&nbsp;Corporate Services Associate . This is an exciting opportunity to work with a diverse portfolio of international clients, leading on the delivery of high quality corporate secretarial and compliance services across multiple jurisdictions. As primary day-to-day contact for our clients, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring compliance and building strong, trusted relationships that span the globe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Key Responsibilities&nbsp;

• Serve as lead client contact for assigned clients and coordinate the delivery of company secretarial services in collaboration with in-country experts.&nbsp;

• Respond promptly and professionally to client queries and requests, ensuring exceptional service and client satisfaction.

• Proactively monitor deadlines and ensure ongoing compliance with statutory and regulatory requirements.&nbsp;

• Prepare and file statutory documents including annual returns, confirmation statements, and regulatory filings with Companies House.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Draft and review board resolutions, minutes, and other corporate documentation.&nbsp;

• Maintain data and document storage within Diligent Entities software.&nbsp;

• Support junior members of the team in developing their knowledge and skills base.

• Collaborate with internal teams and external partners to ensure seamless service delivery

• Apply strong organisational, analytical, and problem-solving skills to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environme

